Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:01.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Mọi thứ sinh ra
Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.44,0:00:02.88,Default,,0,0,0,,để vừa khít với
Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.88,0:00:04.32,Default,,0,0,0,,nhau — xem mà
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.32,0:00:05.76,Default,,0,0,0,,đã cái tay!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.06,0:00:07.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Số năm: chìa khóa
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.76,0:00:09.47,Default,,0,0,0,,cắm vào ổ khóa,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.47,0:00:11.17,Default,,0,0,0,,xoay một cái là
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.17,0:00:12.88,Default,,0,0,0,,mở. Nghe tiếng cạch
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.88,0:00:14.58,Default,,0,0,0,,mà sướng cả người.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.98,0:00:16.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Số bốn: bản lề
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.31,0:00:17.64,Default,,0,0,0,,cửa khép lại vừa
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.64,0:00:18.98,Default,,0,0,0,,khít, không hở một
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.98,0:00:20.31,Default,,0,0,0,,khe nào. Nhìn thôi
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.31,0:00:21.64,Default,,0,0,0,,đã thấy gọn.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.04,0:00:23.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Số ba: hòn đá
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.47,0:00:24.89,Default,,0,0,0,,vừa đúng lòng bàn
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.89,0:00:26.32,Default,,0,0,0,,tay. Cầm lên là
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.32,0:00:27.74,Default,,0,0,0,,muốn cầm mãi, không
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.74,0:00:29.17,Default,,0,0,0,,muốn bỏ xuống.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.57,0:00:30.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Số hai: bánh xe
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.83,0:00:32.09,Default,,0,0,0,,tải chạy đúng vào
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.09,0:00:33.35,Default,,0,0,0,,khe. Như thể cái
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.35,0:00:34.61,Default,,0,0,0,,khe sinh ra cho
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.61,0:00:35.87,Default,,0,0,0,,nó.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.47,0:00:37.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Số một: chốt cửa
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.83,0:00:39.19,Default,,0,0,0,,sập vào đúng lỗ.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.19,0:00:40.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Một tiếng cạch duy
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.56,0:00:41.92,Default,,0,0,0,,nhất — cả video
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.92,0:00:43.28,Default,,0,0,0,,chỉ chờ khoảnh khắc
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.28,0:00:44.64,Default,,0,0,0,,này.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.04,0:00:46.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Cái nào vừa khít
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.72,0:00:48.40,Default,,0,0,0,,nhất? Bình luận nhé!
